      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠣᠪᠴᠢ</unicode>
      <uighur>tobči</uighur>
      <cyrillic>товч</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TOBCI</transcript>
      <definition>a.) n. Button; nipple, teat; bullet. 

b) n. and adj. Abbreviation, abridgment; outline; summary, resume; essence or point of a matter; abridged, abbreviated, brief.</definition>
      <page>810</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠪᠴᠢ ᠲᠠᠶᠢᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
